🇪🇺 EU foreign ministers have approved a new sanctions package aimed at individuals and organizations connected to the Azmar regime. The measures are in response to human rights concerns and destabilizing activities in the region. Details of the sanctioned parties and sectors won’t be public until they’re formally published. Asset freezes and travel bans are included in the package. 🚫
